      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Greene Property is delighted to present \"Castleroe\", Castletown Road, Dundalk, Co. Louth A91 V0N1 an impressive and exceptionally spacious six residence extending to approximately 255 sq. m. offering a remarkable combination of generous living accommodation versatility and substantial outbuilding which are ideal for residential development.\n\nPositioned along the highly convenient Castletown Road and within easy reach of Dundalk town centre, this distinctive property immediately stands apart for the sheer scale of accommodation on offer. Behind its understated façade lies an expansive home with beautifully proportioned reception rooms, extensive bedroom accommodation and a superb private rear courtyard with substantial outbuildings. It is a perfect opportunity for a buyer/investor who wants to generate a rental income portfolio.\n\nThe welcoming entrance opens into a bright hallway, setting the tone for the spacious interiors beyond. At the heart of the home is an impressive sitting room measuring approximately 5.5m x 5.2m, an elegant and inviting space enhanced by attractive wall panelling, plantation-style shutters and generous proportions.\n\nA second living room provides further valuable reception space, while the adjoining office creates an ideal setting for those working from home. Together, these rooms give the property a wonderful sense of flexibility, with ample space for both entertaining and everyday family life.\n\nThe accommodation flows through to a dedicated dining room and generously sized fitted kitchen, creating a practical yet sociable heart to the home. The kitchen features an excellent range of cabinetry and worktop space, while the adjoining areas provide further scope for family dining and entertaining.\n\nWhat truly distinguishes this property is the extensive additional accommodation extending towards the rear. This section incorporates a utility room, WC, further bedrooms and ensuite facilities, providing a highly adaptable layout that could particularly appeal to a large or extended family.\n\nThe first floor of the main residence continues to impress with four generously proportioned bedrooms. The principal bedroom is particularly spacious at approximately 4.9m x 4.25m and benefits from its own ensuite. A family bathroom and additional WC complete the upstairs accommodation.\n\nExternally, \"Castleroe\" offers something equally impressive. To the rear lies a substantial private enclosed courtyard, predominantly finished in concrete and providing an exceptional amount of usable outdoor parking space. A covered seating and entertaining area creates an attractive setting for outdoor dining, while the extensive yard provides considerable flexibility.\n\nFurther enhancing the property are the substantial outbuildings, workshop and storage areas positioned around the courtyard. These spaces are a particularly valuable feature and offer considerable potential for storage, hobbies, workshop use or other purposes such as apartment development subject to any necessary permissions.\n\nWith approximately 255 sq. m. of accommodation, multiple reception rooms, extensive bedroom and bathroom facilities, a home office, a substantial private courtyard and significant outbuildings, this is a property of impressive proportions and exceptional versatility.\n\nIts convenient Dundalk location further enhances its appeal, with the town centre, schools, shops, sporting facilities and everyday amenities all within easy reach, together with convenient access to the wider road network.\n\n\"Castleroe\" represents a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial and highly versatile home where space, convenience and potential come together in one impressive property. Early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the scale and character of this exceptional residence.\n\nKey Features\nImpressive residence extending to approximately 255 sq. m.\nHighly convenient Castletown Road location\nExceptional scale and versatility throughout\nBeautifully presented, generously proportioned sitting room\nMultiple reception and living spaces\nDedicated home office\nSolar Panels\nSpacious fitted kitchen and separate dining area\nExtensive bedroom accommodation\nMultiple ensuite facilities\nFamily bathroom and additional WCs\nSeparate utility room\nSubstantial private enclosed rear courtyard\nCovered outdoor dining and entertaining area\nExtensive outbuildings, workshop and storage space\nIdeally suited to larger or extended families\nConvenient to Dundalk town centre and local amenities\nA distinctive property offering outstanding space and potential\n\nAll measurements and floor plans are approximate and are provided for identification and guidance purposes only.\n\n"
      },
